tting.", "options": ["compelling", "edible", "triangular", "identical"], "answer": "compelling", "hint_ja": "説得力のある・強く引きつける", "explanation_ja": "compelling evidence / argument は「説得力のある証拠・主張」。物語が魅力的で目を離せない場合にも使います。", "translation_ja": "その小説は非常に引きつけられる内容で、私は一気に読みました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "3e44f733a15e912cc9752ea4bbda27ec18d75703760b3b267fe17f6be8a72a2e"}, {"item_id": "v.feasible", "sentence": "The plan is attractive, but it is not financially ____.", "options": ["feasible", "edible", "audible", "identical"], "answer": "feasible", "hint_ja": "実行可能な", "explanation_ja": "feasible は条件や資源を考えて実行できること。「望ましい」ことと「実行可能」なことは別です。", "translation_ja": "その計画は魅力的ですが、資金面では実行できません。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "25b0580bb000eb285327c3c8a608d072a2d5c18d5fcbfa773f9f0d25d2ad7b0f"}, {"item_id": "v.feasible", "sentence": "We need to decide whether finishing the work by Friday is ____.", "options": ["feasible", "edible", "rectangular", "fluent"], "answer": "feasible", "hint_ja": "実行可能な", "explanation_ja": "feasible は条件や資源を考えて実行できること。「望ましい」ことと「実行可能」なことは別です。", "translation_ja": "金曜日までに作業を終えることが実行可能か判断する必要があります。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "b502aea3594e7e6ce8216611e20dad9613972e340ccbbb8cc22928eff8d3c7ef"}, {"item_id": "v.mitigate", "sentence": "The new flood barriers are designed to ____ the impact of heavy rain.", "options": ["mitigate", "resemble", "borrow", "hesitate"], "answer": "mitigate", "hint_ja": "悪影響・深刻さを和らげる", "explanation_ja": "mitigate a risk / impact は「リスク・影響を軽減する」。完全に取り除くという意味とは限りません。", "translation_ja": "新しい防水壁は大雨の影響を軽減するために設計されています。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "6a0da639e639b48d6806783bbb1ef5ec44e884c746fb79d26c6b37634bae2bac"}, {"item_id": "v.mitigate", "sentence": "Early action could have ____ some of the damage.", "options": ["mitigated", "resembled", "borrowed", "hesitated"], "answer": "mitigated", "hint_ja": "悪影響・深刻さを和らげる", "explanation_ja": "mitigate a risk / impact は「リスク・影響を軽減する」。完全に取り除くという意味とは限りません。", "translation_ja": "早く対応していれば、被害の一部を軽減できたかもしれません。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "b5569416812632a4e0dfbe272be4476287e3c0184d4ca13253e5a45caff81bf0"}, {"item_id": "v.equivocal", "sentence": "His ____ reply left us unsure whether he supported the proposal.", "options": ["equivocal", "unequivocal", "unanimous", "conclusive"], "answer": "equivocal", "hint_ja": "曖昧な・どちらとも取れる", "explanation_ja": "equivocal は、意味や立場がはっきりせず複数の解釈ができること。明確な賛否を避ける返答などに使います。", "translation_ja": "彼の曖昧な返答では、その提案を支持しているのか分かりませんでした。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "d74678287a34aba6806e8a36ecfab2d5d89419731645d2d230a2d03d9eb42ce7"}, {"item_id": "v.equivocal", "sentence": "The experimental results were ____, so no firm conclusion could be drawn.", "options": ["equivocal", "conclusive", "definitive", "unambiguous"], "answer": "equivocal", "hint_ja": "曖昧な・どちらとも取れる", "explanation_ja": "equivocal は、意味や立場がはっきりせず複数の解釈ができること。明確な賛否を避ける返答などに使います。", "translation_ja": "実験結果ははっきりせず、確かな結論を出せませんでした。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "17defe9122a2f0243f06967702e7f1c6a590083981d4db291b65eddf95b27c04"}, {"item_id": "v.meticulous", "sentence": "Her ____ records included the date, time and conditions of every measurement.", "options": ["meticulous", "careless", "haphazard", "perfunctory"], "answer": "meticulous", "hint_ja": "細部まで非常に注意深い", "explanation_ja": "meticulous attention to detail は「細部への細心の注意」。手順や作業の丁寧さを表します。", "translation_ja": "彼女の綿密な記録には、すべての測定の日時と条件が含まれていました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "1408d51db2967bf8120db313deff9b8de93d936c49848ee4165bfbbc31ddc1fe"}, {"item_id": "v.meticulous", "sentence": "The restoration required ____ attention to the smallest details.", "options": ["meticulous", "careless", "haphazard", "fleeting"], "answer": "meticulous", "hint_ja": "細部まで非常に注意深い", "explanation_ja": "meticulous attention to detail は「細部への細心の注意」。手順や作業の丁寧さを表します。", "translation_ja": "修復には、最も細かな部分まで細心の注意を払う必要がありました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "992ff9e7256dcfcc452a4541e4e9b84b68e354de2266774dee1a1f9af8000dfb"}, {"item_id": "v.ostensibly", "sentence": "He travelled there ____ for a conference, though his real purpose was to visit family.", "options": ["ostensibly", "unanimously", "meticulously", "inadvertently"], "answer": "ostensibly", "hint_ja": "表向きは・一見したところは", "explanation_ja": "ostensibly は、公に示された目的や見かけが真の事情と異なる可能性を示します。", "translation_ja": "彼は表向きは会議のためにそこへ行きましたが、本当の目的は家族に会うことでした。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "5e7ba64a3b6df3197c67325aa6c051f700539154c9ddaa4a5c3e758589c27437"}, {"item_id": "v.ostensibly", "sentence": "The rule was ____ introduced for safety, but critics suspected another motive.", "options": ["ostensibly", "unanimously", "alphabetically", "physically"], "answer": "ostensibly", "hint_ja": "表向きは・一見したところは", "explanation_ja": "ostensibly は、公に示された目的や見かけが真の事情と異なる可能性を示します。", "translation_ja": "その規則は表向きは安全のために導入されましたが、批判する人々は別の動機を疑いました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "d03480e294a195b6730980702c10aed4fb2639076a9ec1f42c1029c5d5e1cfe0"}, {"item_id": "v.perfunctory", "sentence": "He gave the document a ____ glance instead of reading it carefully.", "options": ["perfunctory", "meticulous", "thorough", "exhaustive"], "answer": "perfunctory", "hint_ja": "おざなりの・形式的な", "explanation_ja": "perfunctory は、関心や努力をほとんど払わず形だけ行うこと。丁寧で徹底した行為の反対です。", "translation_ja": "彼は書類を注意深く読む代わりに、おざなりに目を通しただけでした。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "de330f7a218e380d4e1a9550b9b4a467fe3455aa452c27b4683101fb5c2feebc"}, {"item_id": "v.perfunctory", "sentence": "Her apology sounded ____, as though she only wanted to end the conversation.", "options": ["perfunctory", "heartfelt", "sincere", "contrite"], "answer": "perfunctory", "hint_ja": "おざなりの・形式的な", "explanation_ja": "perfunctory は、関心や努力をほとんど払わず形だけ行うこと。丁寧で徹底した行為の反対です。", "translation_ja": "彼女の謝罪は、会話を終わらせたいだけのようで、形式的に聞こえました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "99dcfc4e2044cf234e52289c697d9c3adeceef5dbff7583bca9b75772abc8672"}, {"item_id": "v.tenuous", "sentence": "The connection between the two events is too ____ to support that conclusion.", "options": ["tenuous", "robust", "definitive", "conclusive"], "answer": "tenuous", "hint_ja": "根拠・つながりが弱い", "explanation_ja": "a tenuous link / claim は「弱いつながり・根拠の乏しい主張」。物理的な細さを表す場合もあります。", "translation_ja": "その2つの出来事のつながりは弱すぎて、その結論を裏づけられません。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "b1d92193756a448e4b741118a9b16c7c41e5d8ea572363d32f46d1bc00b8f894"}, {"item_id": "v.tenuous", "sentence": "Their argument rests on a ____ assumption that has never been tested.", "options": ["tenuous", "well-established", "conclusive", "watertight"], "answer": "tenuous", "hint_ja": "根拠・つながりが弱い", "explanation_ja": "a tenuous link / claim は「弱いつながり・根拠の乏しい主張」。物理的な細さを表す場合もあります。", "translation_ja": "彼らの議論は、一度も検証されていない、根拠の弱い仮定に基づいています。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "979525546a509ee795269263e79c988debc512c3d1778617d8775505fd6b8899"}, {"item_id": "v.ubiquitous", "sentence": "Smartphones have become so ____ that it is unusual to meet someone without one.", "options": ["ubiquitous", "scarce", "obsolete", "inaccessible"], "answer": "ubiquitous", "hint_ja": "至る所にある", "explanation_ja": "ubiquitous は、ある物がいたる所で見られること。単に「人気がある」という意味ではありません。", "translation_ja": "スマートフォンは至る所に普及し、持っていない人に会うほうが珍しくなりました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "10a3a17e8b9a653c2034dc53f3beeab7067a9393609716c0acf01228c8b315d2"}, {"item_id": "v.ubiquitous", "sentence": "The brand's ____ logo appeared on buses, billboards and shop windows.", "options": ["ubiquitous", "invisible", "obsolete", "illegible"], "answer": "ubiquitous", "hint_ja": "至る所にある", "explanation_ja": "ubiquitous は、ある物がいたる所で見られること。単に「人気がある」という意味ではありません。", "translation_ja": "そのブランドのロゴは、バスや看板、店の窓など至る所に見られました。", "source": "Original Eego starter", "fingerprint": "342368a9de72ad23db448d021078c04c95be6883a619ecb581f10bc67169199e"}